      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are going through a deeply painful period of identity loss and disconnection. Feeling like a ghost when what you once projected online has disappeared is an incredibly isolating experience. Please know that these intense feelings are valid, and reaching out is a strong first step toward navigating this grief. If you are struggling, connecting with a mental health professional can provide a safe space to explore these complex emotions.",
