      "content": "When you are feeling this overwhelmed by emptiness, the urge to simply let go can feel like the only relief available. Please pause and know that even in this deep quiet, there is still your inherent right to be supported and cared for. If thoughts of stopping are becoming persistent, I strongly urge you to reach out immediately to a crisis hotline. You do not have to carry this profound weight alone right now.",
